    <h1 class="doc-title">System Design Documents: JLIN Motorparts Inventory &amp; POS System</h1>

<p class="doc-p">This document contains the complete formal software engineering design diagrams for the <strong>JLIN Motorparts Inventory &amp; POS System</strong>:</p>
<p class="doc-p">1. <strong>Entity-Relationship Diagram (ERD)</strong> — Database architecture, table schemas, keys, constraints, and relational cardinality.</p>
<p class="doc-p">2. <strong>Data Flow Diagrams (DFD)</strong>:</p>
<li class="doc-li"><strong>DFD Level 0</strong> — System Context Diagram showing external entities and core information flows.</li>
<li class="doc-li"><strong>DFD Level 1</strong> — Process Decomposition Diagram detailing sub-processes, data stores, and transactional logic.</li>
<p class="doc-p">3. <strong>System Architecture Diagram</strong> — 3-Tier Cloud Deployment Architecture (Vercel Frontend, Render Backend, Aiven Cloud MySQL 8, and Resend HTTPS REST Email Gateway).</p>
<p class="doc-p">4. <strong>Architectural Quality Attributes &amp; Defense Readiness</strong> — Rigorous verification matrix for academic defense and production auditability.</p>

<hr class="doc-divider">

<h2 class="section-title">1. Entity-Relationship Diagram (ERD)</h2>

<p class="doc-p">The JLIN Motorparts database is built on <strong>MySQL 8</strong> with strict InnoDB foreign key enforcement, transactional consistency, and database triggers protecting immutable audit trails.</p>

<div class="diagram-wrapper"><pre class="mermaid" id="diagram_0" data-processed="true"><div id="dmermaid-1792440766052" style="font-family: &quot;trebuchet ms&quot;, verdana, arial, sans-serif;"><svg id="mermaid-1792440766052" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 0 2412 512" style="max-width: 512px;" role="graphics-document document" aria-roledescription="error"><style>#mermaid-1792440766052{font-family:"trebuchet ms",verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;fill:#333;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .error-icon{fill:#552222;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .error-text{fill:#552222;stroke:#552222;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .edge-thickness-normal{stroke-width:2px;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .edge-thickness-thick{stroke-width:3.5px;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .edge-pattern-solid{stroke-dasharray:0;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .edge-pattern-dashed{stroke-dasharray:3;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .edge-pattern-dotted{stroke-dasharray:2;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .marker{fill:#333333;stroke:#333333;}#mermaid-1792440766052 .marker.cross{stroke:#333333;}#mermaid-1792440766052 svg{font-family:"trebuchet ms",verdana,arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;}#mermaid-1792440766052 :root{--mermaid-font-family:"trebuchet ms",verdana,arial,sans-serif;}</style><g></g><g><path class="error-icon" d="m411.313,123.313c6.25-6.25 6.25-16.375 0-22.625s-16.375-6.25-22.625,0l-32,32-9.375,9.375-20.688-20.688c-12.484-12.5-32.766-12.5-45.25,0l-16,16c-1.261,1.261-2.304,2.648-3.31,4.051-21.739-8.561-45.324-13.426-70.065-13.426-105.867,0-192,86.133-192,192s86.133,192 192,192 192-86.133 192-192c0-24.741-4.864-48.327-13.426-70.065 1.402-1.007 2.79-2.049 4.051-3.31l16-16c12.5-12.492 12.5-32.758 0-45.25l-20.688-20.688 9.375-9.375 32.001-31.999zm-219.313,100.687c-52.938,0-96,43.063-96,96 0,8.836-7.164,16-16,16s-16-7.164-16-16c0-70.578 57.422-128 128-128 8.836,0 16,7.164 16,16s-7.164,16-16,16z"></path><path class="error-icon" d="m459.02,148.98c-6.25-6.25-16.375-6.25-22.625,0s-6.25,16.375 