<h2 class="section-title">3. System Architecture Diagram</h2>

<p class="doc-p">The system follows a modern <strong>3-Tier Web Architecture</strong> built for cloud-native deployment with strict HTTPS, zero-trust backend authorization, and managed database high availability.</p>

